@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-38 - Send Order Status Email

actor "System" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB
participant "Gmail SMTP" as Gmail

Actor -> Service: Domain status changed
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service -> Gmail: Send notification email when configured
Gmail --> Service: Delivery accepted or warning logged
Service --> Actor: Notification flow completed

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Gửi thất bại -> log lỗi, không block luồng chính
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Order status thay đổi
Post: Email được gửi cho khách hàng
Main flow:
1. Hệ thống phát hiện status thay đổi
2. System xác định template email phù hợp (confirmed, shipped, delivered)
3. System gọi Nodemailer transporter.sendMail()
4. Email được gửi đến email khách hàng
5. System log kết quả
end note
@enduml
